  "description": "Fluent, strongly-typed bulk insert for PostgreSQL - map each property to its column type and stream entities straight into Npgsql's binary COPY, with quoted identifiers, null-aware writes, and no hand-rolled importer code.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
